      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Catra is a deep undercover KGB operative in the United States, and Adora is an FBI agent. Itâ€™s Washington D.C. and the height of the Cold War. Adora moves in right across the street from Catra. What could go wrong?&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
